| Field    | Type                 | Required | Description                                                |
| -------- | -------------------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |
| `type`   | string               | Yes      | `"list_conversations"`                                     |
| `limit`  | integer (1–200)      | No       | Maximum conversations to return                            |
| `before` | `ConversationCursor` | No       | Page cursor: the last row the caller saw                   |

A `ConversationCursor` carries both `updatedAt` (an ISO date string) and `sessionId`: the session id is the tie-break when two conversations share an activity time, so a pair of tied conversations cannot straddle a page boundary.

